<div class="mandarin-hanzi">火车</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">huǒchē</div>

''Meaning:'' train  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
我们坐火车去北京。 — Wǒmen zuò huǒchē qù Běijīng. — We’re taking the train to Beijing.

!! Usage note
坐火车 (zuò huǒchē) means 'travel by train'. 火车站 (huǒchēzhàn) is a train station; 高铁 (gāotiě) specifically refers to high-speed rail.
